<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Application Submitted Successfully | Narsimha Astro</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --maroon: #631a2a;
      --gold: #d7a34e;
      --cream: #fff9ef;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: #39231f;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    header {
      background: var(--maroon);
      color: #f8d590;
      padding: 20px 7%;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .brand {
      font: 700 clamp(19px, 3vw, 26px) Georgia, serif;
      letter-spacing: .5px;
    }

    .home-link {
      color: #ffe0a4;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    main {
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 56px 18px;
    }

    .success-card {
      width: min(100%, 610px);
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid #eadac2;
      border-radius: 18px;
      box-shadow: 0 15px 45px #51221918;
      padding: clamp(30px, 6vw, 58px);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .check {
      margin: 0 auto 24px;
      width: 94px;
      height: 94px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background: #edf8ef;
      border: 3px solid #369d58;
      border-radius: 50%;
      color: #268746;
      font-size: 55px;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    h1 {
      font: 700 clamp(28px, 5vw, 40px)/1.2 Georgia, serif;
      color: var(--maroon);
      margin: 0 0 20px;
    }

    p {
      color: #655650;
      line-height: 1.8;
      font-size: 16px;
      margin: 0 0 18px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 14px;
      padding: 15px 30px;
      border-radius: 7px;
      background: var(--maroon);
      color: white;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: #842b39;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 22px 16px;
      background: #37141c;
      color: #e5cdbb;
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media(max-width:480px) {
      header {
        padding: 18px 5%;
      }

      .home-link {
        font-size: 14px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">NARSIMHA ASTRO</div>
  </header>
  <main>
    <section class="success-card" aria-labelledby="success-title">
      <div class="check" aria-hidden="true">✓</div>
      <h1 id="success-title">Application Submitted Successfully!</h1>
      <p>Thank you for applying to join <strong>Narsimha Astro</strong> as an astrologer.</p>
      <p>We have received your application. Our team will review your details and contact you regarding the next steps,
        including a video interview if shortlisted.</p>
      <a class="button" href="/">Back to Home</a>
    </section>
  </main>
  <footer>© 2026 Narsimha Astro · Vedic wisdom for modern life</footer>
</body>

</html>